---
import BlockLayout from '../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
const description = 'Play a four-round Spellframe co-op card battle with a practice partner or your paired AI. Choose a spell, plan a support move, and close the rift together.';
---
<BlockLayout title="Co-games — Two against the rift" description={description} image="/images/spellframe/arena.webp" immersive={true} jsonLd={{ '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'VideoGame', name: 'Co-games: Two against the rift', description, url: 'https://pointcast.xyz/co-games', playMode: 'CoOp', isAccessibleForFree: true }} alternates={[{type:'application/json',href:'/co-games.json',title:'Co-games rules and AI move contract'}]}>
<article class="co-games-page">
<div id="pointcast-co-games" aria-label="Spellframe co-op practice game">

<div class="cg-top"><a href="/" class="cg-brand">PointCast</a><span class="cg-meta">Co-games · free practice</span></div>
<div class="cg-heading"><div><div class="cg-meta">Spellframe / Two against the rift</div><h1>Two against the rift.</h1><p class="cg-team">You choose the spell. Your partner completes the play.</p></div><span class="cg-round" data-round>ROUND 1 / 4</span></div>
<div class="cg-arena" aria-label="Shared battle board">
  <div class="cg-encounter"><div><div class="cg-enemy-name">The rift</div><div class="cg-enemy-hp"><span data-enemy>18</span> <small>/ 18 strength</small></div></div><div class="cg-orb" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
  <div class="cg-threats" aria-label="Incoming attack each round"><span>INCOMING</span><span class="cg-threat" data-threat="0">4</span><span class="cg-threat" data-threat="1">6</span><span class="cg-threat" data-threat="2">5</span><span class="cg-threat" data-threat="3">7</span></div>
  <div class="cg-health-row"><span><span data-team-name>You + practice partner</span> · shared health</span><strong data-health>14 / 14</strong></div><div class="cg-health" role="progressbar" aria-label="Team health" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="14" aria-valuenow="14"><div class="cg-health-fill"></div></div>
</div>
<section class="cg-connection" aria-label="Choose your partner">
  <div class="cg-mode-row"><label for="cg-mode">Play with</label><select id="cg-mode" data-mode><option value="practice">Practice partner · simulated</option><option value="native">Your AI · paired computer</option></select><a href="/me#my-ai">My AI ↗</a></div>
  <div data-native-controls hidden><div class="cg-native-row"><label for="cg-runtime" class="cg-sr">Choose your connected AI</label><select id="cg-runtime" data-runtime></select><button type="button" class="cg-link" data-refresh>Check connection</button></div><p class="cg-runtime-status" data-runtime-status aria-live="polite"></p><p class="cg-runtime-note">One support request uses one task from your subscription. Your computer must stay awake.</p></div>
</section>
<div data-play>
  <div class="cg-label-row"><strong>Your spell</strong><span data-focus-status>Choose one card</span></div>
  <div class="cg-hand" aria-label="Choose your spell">
    <button type="button" class="cg-card" data-card="ember" aria-pressed="true"><span class="cg-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="cg-card-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span class="cg-card-name">Ember</span><span class="cg-card-effect" data-effect="ember">Deal 4 damage.</span><span class="cg-uses" data-uses="ember">3 casts left</span></button>
    <button type="button" class="cg-card" data-card="root" aria-pressed="false"><span class="cg-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="cg-card-mark" aria-hidden="true">♧</span><span class="cg-card-name">Root</span><span class="cg-card-effect" data-effect="root">Deal 2. Block 3.</span><span class="cg-uses">Always available</span></button>
    <button type="button" class="cg-card" data-card="focus" aria-pressed="false"><span class="cg-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="cg-card-mark" aria-hidden="true">◈</span><span class="cg-card-name">Focus</span><span class="cg-card-effect">Double your next damaging spell.</span><span class="cg-uses" data-uses="focus">1 cast left</span></button>
  </div>
  <section class="cg-planning" aria-label="Private planning with your partner">
    <div class="cg-partner-top"><span class="cg-partner-name"><span data-partner-name>Practice partner</span><span class="cg-partner-badge">private planning</span></span><button type="button" class="cg-link" data-another>Try another support</button></div>
    <p class="cg-partner-line" data-partner></p>
    <p class="cg-support-stock" data-stock>Support left: Echo 2 · Ward 2 · Mend 1</p>
    <div class="cg-forecast" data-forecast aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>
  </section>
  <div class="cg-native-actions" data-native-actions hidden><button type="button" class="cg-cast" data-request>Ask my AI for support</button><button type="button" class="cg-link" data-cancel hidden>Cancel request</button><details class="cg-rules"><summary>What your AI receives</summary><pre data-prompt-preview></pre></details></div>
<div class="cg-actions"><button type="button" class="cg-cast" data-cast>Cast together</button><span class="cg-turn-state" data-turn-state>Your turn · confirm the pair</span></div>
</div>
<div class="cg-result" data-result hidden aria-live="polite"><h3 data-result-title></h3><p data-result-copy></p><button type="button" class="cg-cast" data-replay>Play again</button></div>
<p class="cg-last" data-last aria-live="polite">Close the rift within four rounds and keep your team alive.</p>
<details class="cg-log" data-log hidden><summary>Our moves · <span data-count>0</span></summary><ol data-log-items></ol></details>
<details class="cg-rules"><summary>Rules &amp; partners</summary><p>Each round, cast one spell and one support. You both attack at once with the rift. Healing happens first, up to 14 health; block lasts one round. Win by reducing the rift to 0 while staying above 0 health. If both fall, or the rift survives round four, you lose.</p><p>Focus doubles your next spell’s damage, including Root, but does not double block or your partner’s damage.</p><p>Your partner has Echo (2 damage, two uses), Ward (3 block, two uses), and Mend (3 healing, one use). The practice partner is simulated and looks ahead at visible cards. Your AI uses a paired Codex or Claude runtime from My AI. Its computer must be awake with the companion running. Each requested support uses one task from your existing subscription. Both modes use the same rules; your AI receives only the game state and your selected spell. This free practice game has no prizes or purchases. Progress resets when you reload.</p></details>
</div>
<nav class="cg-footer" aria-label="Game links"><a href="/spellframe">The Spellframe world ↗</a><a href="/co-games.json">Rules for agents ↗</a><a href="/play">More to play ↗</a></nav>
</article>
</BlockLayout>
<script>
import { mountCoGames } from '../lib/co-games-ui';
let cleanup: (() => void) | undefined;
function setup() {
  cleanup?.();
  const root = document.getElementById('pointcast-co-games');
  cleanup = root ? mountCoGames(root) : undefined;
}
setup();
document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', setup);
document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap', () => { cleanup?.(); cleanup = undefined; });
</script>
<style is:global>
#pointcast-co-games{--cg-paper:light-dark(#fffcf5,#20231d);--cg-ink:light-dark(#1d271f,#f5eddd);--cg-muted:light-dark(#6b705f,#b9bfad);--cg-line:light-dark(#d6d2c2,#4d5645);--cg-wash:light-dark(#eeeee3,#2e3829);--cg-green:light-dark(#30462e,#d1dfbf);--cg-inverse:light-dark(#fffdf4,#24331d);--cg-ember:light-dark(#a84c2d,#efa780);--cg-violet:light-dark(#674879,#c4a5df);--cg-mat:light-dark(#1e2825,#171e1b);--cg-mat-ink:light-dark(#f5eede,#f5eede);--cg-mat-muted:light-dark(#b7c2ab,#b7c2ab);--cg-rift:light-dark(#ec9c69,#e6aa87);--cg-radius:3px;background:var(--cg-paper);color:var(--cg-ink);font:14px/1.45 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--cg-line);box-sizing:border-box;isolation:isolate}
#pointcast-co-games *{box-sizing:border-box}
#pointcast-co-games [hidden]{display:none!important}
#pointcast-co-games button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}
#pointcast-co-games button:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.43}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:2px solid var(--cg-ink);padding-bottom:13px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-brand{font-weight:750;font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-1px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-meta{font:11px/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cg-muted)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:21px 0 16px}
#pointcast-co-games h1{font-size:29px;letter-spacing:-1px;line-height:1.1;margin:4px 0 0}
#pointcast-co-games p{margin:0}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-team{font-size:12px;color:var(--cg-muted);margin-top:7px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-round{font:12px/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace;white-space:nowrap}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-arena{color:var(--cg-mat-ink);background:var(--cg-mat);padding:20px 22px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--cg-radius)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-encounter{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 100px;gap:12px;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:1}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-enemy-name{font:12px/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--cg-mat-muted)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-enemy-hp{font-size:35px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-1px;font-weight:650;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin-top:5px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-enemy-hp small{font:12px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--cg-mat-muted);white-space:nowrap}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-orb{width:92px;height:92px;border-radius:50%;position:relative;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 60% 38%,var(--cg-rift) 0%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--cg-rift),transparent 48%) 3%,transparent 33%),conic-gradient(from 30deg,transparent 0deg,var(--cg-rift) 48deg,transparent 90deg,transparent 200deg,var(--cg-rift) 230deg,transparent 290deg);box-shadow:inset 0 0 23px var(--cg-mat),0 0 34px color-mix(in srgb,var(--cg-rift),transparent 85%);transform:rotate(-25deg)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-orb:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:22px;background:var(--cg-mat);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--cg-mat)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-threats{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px;font:12px/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--cg-mat-muted)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-threat{padding:2px 8px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--cg-mat-muted),transparent 70%);border-radius:2px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-threat[data-now="true"]{background:var(--cg-rift);border-color:var(--cg-rift);color:var(--cg-mat);font-weight:700}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-threat[data-past="true"]{text-decoration:line-through;opacity:.55}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-health-row{margin-top:17px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-health-row strong{white-space:nowrap}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-health{height:6px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--cg-mat-ink),transparent 88%);margin-top:7px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-health-fill{height:100%;width:100%;background:var(--cg-mat-muted);transition:width .25s ease}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-label-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin:20px 0 9px;font-size:12px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-label-row strong{font-weight:700}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-hand{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-card{min-width:0;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:start;text-align:left;padding:13px 12px;background:var(--cg-paper);border:1px solid var(--cg-line);border-radius:var(--cg-radius);color:var(--cg-ink);min-height:159px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-card:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--cg-ink)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-card[aria-pressed="true"]{border:2px solid var(--cg-green);padding:12px 11px;background:var(--cg-wash)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-card .cg-check{position:absolute;right:9px;top:9px;font-size:12px;visibility:hidden}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-card[aria-pressed="true"] .cg-check{visibility:visible}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-card-mark{font:23px/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--cg-ember)}
#pointcast-co-games [data-card="root"] .cg-card-mark{color:var(--cg-green)}
#pointcast-co-games [data-card="focus"] .cg-card-mark{color:var(--cg-violet)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-card-name{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:3px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-card-effect{font-size:12px;line-height:1.4}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-uses{font:11px/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.3px;color:var(--cg-muted);margin-top:auto;padding-top:12px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-planning{margin-top:16px;padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cg-line)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-partner-top{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-partner-name{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-partner-badge{font-size:11px;font-weight:400;margin-left:6px;color:var(--cg-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.3px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-support-stock{font-size:11px;color:var(--cg-muted);margin-top:8px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-partner-line{font-size:14px;max-width:60ch}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-link{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--cg-ink);padding:4px 0;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;font-size:12px;min-height:30px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-forecast{background:var(--cg-wash);padding:10px 12px;margin-top:13px;display:flex;gap:5px 15px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;border-radius:var(--cg-radius)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:14px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-cast{background:var(--cg-green);color:var(--cg-inverse);border:1px solid var(--cg-green);padding:12px 17px;min-height:44px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;border-radius:var(--cg-radius)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-turn-state{font-size:12px;color:var(--cg-muted)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-result{padding:21px 0 4px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-result h3{font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.6px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 8px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-result p{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:14px;color:var(--cg-muted)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-log{font-size:12px;color:var(--cg-muted);margin-top:15px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-log summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:25px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-log ol{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:20px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-log li{margin-bottom:8px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-rules{margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--cg-muted)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-rules summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:25px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-rules p{margin-top:7px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-last{margin-top:15px;font-size:12px;color:var(--cg-muted)}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%)}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){#pointcast-co-games .cg-health-fill{transition:none}}
@media(max-width:430px){#pointcast-co-games{padding:15px}#pointcast-co-games h1{font-size:25px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-arena{padding:15px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-hand{gap:6px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-card{padding:11px 8px;min-height:168px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-card[aria-pressed="true"]{padding:10px 7px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-card-name{font-size:15px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-card-effect{font-size:11px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-uses{font-size:11px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-cast{width:100%}#pointcast-co-games .cg-link{min-height:44px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-encounter{grid-template-columns:1fr 75px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-orb{width:72px;height:72px}}
@media(max-width:390px){#pointcast-co-games .cg-hand{grid-template-columns:1fr}#pointcast-co-games .cg-card{min-height:90px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:24px 1fr;gap:2px 9px;padding:10px 12px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-card[aria-pressed="true"]{padding:9px 11px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-card-mark{grid-row:1 / 4;margin:0}#pointcast-co-games .cg-card-effect,#pointcast-co-games .cg-uses{grid-column:2;font-size:11px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-uses{padding-top:2px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-enemy-hp small{display:block}}

.co-games-page{max-width:850px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 16px 35px;font-family:var(--pc-font-sans)}
.cg-footer{display:flex;gap:20px;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px;font-size:12px}
.cg-footer a{color:inherit}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-brand{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-connection{padding:16px 0 0}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-mode-row,#pointcast-co-games .cg-native-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-mode-row>a{margin-left:auto;color:var(--cg-ink)}
#pointcast-co-games select{background:var(--cg-paper);color:var(--cg-ink);border:1px solid var(--cg-line);border-radius:var(--cg-radius);padding:9px;font:inherit;max-width:100%;min-height:40px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-native-row{margin-top:12px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-runtime-status{font-size:12px;margin-top:8px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-runtime-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--cg-muted);margin-top:5px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-native-actions{margin-top:12px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-native-actions>button{margin-right:12px}
#pointcast-co-games pre{font:11px/1.5 var(--pc-font-mono);white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:var(--cg-wash);padding:12px;max-height:300px;overflow:auto}
#pointcast-co-games button:focus-visible,#pointcast-co-games select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--cg-ember);outline-offset:3px}
#pointcast-co-games .cg-arena{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#14211fea,#14211fbf),url('/images/spellframe/arena.webp') center/cover}

@media(max-width:430px){.co-games-page{padding:0 8px;margin-top:8px}#pointcast-co-games .cg-mode-row label{width:100%}}
</style>
